// Browser half entry for dsh-next-message-predictor.
//
// Registers the ghost overlay into the session-scoped
// `conversation.input.overlay` list slot, contributes its own Settings page via
// `settings.section`, offers the same page as a global panel with an optional
// entry in the left sidebar (`main` + `sidebar.panellist`), owns the page-level
// focus/visibility signals, and exposes a small debug surface for manual
// verification.
//
// The bundle is generated by scripts/build-client.mjs from src/shared/* and
// src/client/* wrapped in the host's ModuleLoader factory; this file must be a
// plain function body (no imports) after concatenation.

